  app/static/vendor/chart.umd.min.js
      Chart.js 4.4.7 — https://www.chartjs.org — MIT License

  app/static/vendor/adaptivecards.min.js
      Adaptive Cards 3.0.6 — https://adaptivecards.io — MIT License
      Full text in app/static/vendor/adaptivecards.LICENSE.txt

Refer to each project for the full text of its license.
